# The npmjs registry is the default for this package.
#
# The @qexle scope used to point at GitHub Packages. That line also caught every
# plain `bun publish` from this folder and sent the package to the wrong
# registry, so it lives here as a comment instead.
#
# To publish to GitHub Packages on purpose:
#
#   bun publish --registry https://npm.pkg.github.com --access public
#
# and add a token for that registry to ~/.npmrc:
#
#   //npm.pkg.github.com/:_authToken=<token>
